## Customizing the Login Page

The login page is a customizable component. You can customize it by passing in a `Login` prop to the `AuthProvider`. The `Login` prop takes an object with two keys: `title`, and `description`. These are used as the title and description of your login page respectively.

```tsx
// app/pages/_app.tsx
import { AuthProvider } from 'next-auth'
import { PageProps  } from 'next'

export default function App({
  Component,
  pageProps: {
    auth: { user },
  },
}: PageProps) {

  return (
    <AuthProvider
      login={{
        title: 'Login',
        description: 'Please sign in to continue.',
      }}
    >
      {/* ... */}
    </AuthProvider>
  )
}
```

